{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two men, both 68. Same town, same bank,\nclose to the same money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6060,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sitting in the same kind of account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8440,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of them woke up on a Tuesday and could\nnot buy food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12480,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$14,000 of his own money was still sitting\nthere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16060,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could see it on the screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18160,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He simply could not touch a cent of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21180,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had broken no law. He had missed no\npayment on anything he knew about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26280,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody had to warn him. Not the bank, not\nthe court, not the person who started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30960,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. The letter that explains it arrives\nafter the money is already locked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35840,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by then the rent has bounced and the\npharmacy has turned him away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41080,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the part that decides which of\nthose two men you are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44740,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was not how much money they had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47080,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was how many places they kept it, and\nwhether the money arriving every month"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51220,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arrived the right way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53740,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five hands can reach into an account like\nthat and stop you using it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58700,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am going to name all five. Two of them\nneed no judge at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62640,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at the end I will give you the one\namount that stays yours no matter which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67000,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hand arrives, and the one condition you\nhave to meet to keep it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71680,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of these five is a secret."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every one of them is written down, in\npublic, on a government website that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77580,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costs nothing to open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79460,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do damage for one reason only."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81340,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one is learned on the day it happens,\nby the person it happens to, standing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86920,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a counter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88580,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hand number one. Your own bank, and it\nneeds no permission but its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93040,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the one almost nobody sees coming,\nbecause it does not feel like a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98460,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stranger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99480,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you owe that same bank money on a car\nloan, a personal loan, or an overdraft,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105080,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bank is allowed to reach into your\nchecking or savings account at that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109240,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same bank and take what you owe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111920,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No court. No hearing. No letter first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116000,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is written into the account agreement\nyou signed, and most people signed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119940,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it without reading the page it sits on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122740,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bank calls it a right of setoff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125420,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What it means in plain language is that\nmoney in one building can pay a debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129880,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the same building, and the building\ndecides when."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132980,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now here is the line the banks do not put\nin large print."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137900,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are not allowed to do this for a\ncredit card balance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141540,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a federal rule and it is specific."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145600,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A card company cannot take money out of\nyour checking or savings account to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149940,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cover what you owe on their card, and it\ncannot simply freeze that account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154280,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to squeeze you either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156360,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under the rule, freezing counts as taking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159000,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how much that one sentence is\nworth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163380,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Card debt is the debt most people over 65\nactually carry, and it is the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168780,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debt that cannot reach your account this\nway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171660,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if a bank tells you it has taken your\nmoney for a card debt, that is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176060,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sentence to repeat back to them, in\nwriting, that day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179600,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And notice what the whole thing depends\non."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181940,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The loan and the account have to be at the\nsame bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184680,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they are not, this hand cannot reach\nyou at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188560,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hand number two. The government, and this\none also skips the courtroom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193880,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you owe back taxes, the tax office does\nnot have to sue you first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198660,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can send an order straight to your\nbank, and your bank must hold the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203200,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the piece almost nobody is told."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205800,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bank holds it for 21 days before it\nsends it anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209180,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not a formality. That is a window,\nand it is the only one you get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213780,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people spend the first two weeks of\nit frightened and silent, and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218980,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it closes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220420,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a second version of this that\nnever touches your bank at all, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224480,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it takes the money before it ever arrives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227360,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you owe a federal debt, such as a\nstudent loan that went into default, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232160,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "government can take a slice out of your\nmonthly benefit at the source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235680,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rule puts a ceiling on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238740,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the smaller of three figures, and\none of those figures is the amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242760,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by which your monthly benefit rises above\n$750."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247320,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a benefit of $850 loses $100, not the\n15% people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253420,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fear. That floor exists. Almost nobody\nquoting the 15% number mentions it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259820,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hand number three. A debt collector, and\nthis one does have to go through a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264740,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "judge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265700,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A collector cannot simply order your bank\nto freeze anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269440,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First it has to sue you and win."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271820,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then it takes that judgment to a court and\ngets an order, and that order goes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276300,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to your bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277620,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So far that sounds like protection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279920,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is why it is not, for a great many\npeople."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283060,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are sued and you do not answer, the\ncourt can rule against you anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287180,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You lose without ever walking into a room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290640,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the frozen accounts I read about\ndid not come from a fight that was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294460,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lost. They came from an envelope that was\nnever opened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298220,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are ever handed court papers about\na debt, the one thing that matters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that you respond by the date on the\npaper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305240,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even a simple response keeps the door\nopen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308040,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Silence closes it. And notice what gets\nfrozen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311840,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not you. The account. Every dollar in it\nstops at the same moment, including"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317320,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the money that has nothing to do with the\ndebt, including the money your wife"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321500,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "put in, including the money set aside for\nthe funeral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325440,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One account means one switch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327640,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hand number four. A support order for a\nformer wife or a child."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332160,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one surprises people because they\nassume old family matters cannot follow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336580,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a retirement check. They can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339580,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Social Security retirement and disability\npayments can be reached for child"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343480,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "support or spousal support that is owed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345800,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is a line here that is worth\nknowing by name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349120,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The extra payment for people with very\nlittle income, the one that arrives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353200,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on top of a small Social Security check,\nis treated differently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357440,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That payment cannot be taken for support,\nand it cannot be taken for a government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361680,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debt either. It is protected in a way the\nordinary retirement check is not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366700,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So two people can sit at the same table,\nboth over 65, both with a bank account,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371980,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the same order reaches one of them and\nbounces off the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376300,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The difference is which payment they live\non."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378900,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hand number five. The other name on the\naccount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381960,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If somebody else is named on your account,\ntheir debts walk in through your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385500,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386600,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A company your son owes money to can win\nin court against him, and then go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390860,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the account he is named on, even if\nevery dollar in it came from your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395080,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pension. He never touched it. His name on\nthe paperwork was enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399740,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens next depends entirely on\nwhere you live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403240,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some states the law assumes the money\nis split evenly between the two names."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407840,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other states the whole balance can be\ntaken, and it is on you to prove,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412200,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with records going back years, which part\nwas yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415700,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A dozen or so states give married couples\na particular form of joint ownership"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419920,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that keeps one spouse debts away from the\nother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423120,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I cannot tell you which rule your state\nfollows and I am not going to guess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427040,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at it in front of you. What I can tell you\nis that adding a name to an account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431080,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for convenience, so somebody can help with\nthe shopping, is not a small act."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435960,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are other ways to let somebody help\nyou that do not hand your balance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the people they owe. So that is the\nfive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442620,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the part I promised, and it is the\npart worth writing down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447500,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a court order arrives at your bank,\nthe bank is required to look back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451720,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through two months of your account history\nfirst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454740,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever you received in Social Security,\ndisability, veterans benefits, railroad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459860,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "retirement or federal retirement in those\ntwo months is protected and stays"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464820,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "available to you. The bank does this on\nits own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468340,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not have to ask, you do not have to\nfile anything, and you do not have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472800,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to know the rule exists. Say you receive\n$1,000 a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477460,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your bank sees $2,000 of benefits in the\nlast two months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481480,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$2,000 stays yours to spend, that day,\nwhile everything above it may be frozen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487300,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the condition, and it is the whole\nvideo in one sentence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491300,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That protection only exists if the money\narrives by direct deposit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495600,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your benefit comes as a paper check and\nyou walk it into the bank yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500000,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bank is not required to protect\nanything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502620,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not two months. Not one month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505020,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a dollar. The entire balance can be\nfrozen, and then it is on you to go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509580,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a court and prove where the money came\nfrom, while the rent is due."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514100,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same person. Same amount. Same bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517400,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of them keeps $2,000 and one of them\nkeeps nothing, and the only difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521860,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how the money walked in the door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524140,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the difference between the two men\nat the start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527260,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is what this week looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529180,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Find out how your benefit arrives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531300,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it is a check, switch it to direct\ndeposit, and that is one phone call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at whether your loan and your main\naccount sit at the same bank, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539320,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is the only way hand number one can\nreach you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541940,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at whose name is on your account\nbeside yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545380,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if court papers ever arrive, answer\nthem by the date printed on the page,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549360,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if you have nothing to pay with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551800,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Treat this as education and not as advice\nabout your own money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555640,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your state, your account and your own\npaperwork are three things I cannot see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560160,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those three decide your answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562520,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if your mother or your father still\ngets a paper check, do not send them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566360,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this video. Sit down beside them,\ntelephone the office together, and switch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570720,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it while you are in the room. The two\nmonths only protects the people who did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574400,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that before the order arrived."
    } ]
  } ]
}
